Package: kconsensus
Title: Transparent Consensus Diagnostics for K-Means Cluster Counts
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("UZUB18", email = "trbuzu@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Compares candidate K-means cluster counts using the silhouette,
    Calinski-Harabasz, Davies-Bouldin and Dunn indices, the gap statistic and
    an optional elbow rule. Grades the support for the leading count as
    unanimous, majority, plurality, single vote or tie, flags votes at the edge
    of the tested range, records why methods abstain, and provides customizable
    plots, without treating vote agreement as statistical confidence.
